Two components from PhysioNet (https://physionet.org/), both GPL-2.0-or-later (COPYING in this
directory is the GNU GPL version 2; under the "or later" option the code is distributed within
pyhctsa under GPL-3.0-or-later). The PhysioNet project pages additionally state the Open Data
Commons Attribution License v1.0, which is satisfied by this attribution.

1. sampen.c -- "sampen: calculate Sample Entropy", Copyright (C) 2002-2004 Doug Lake.
   Revisions by George Moody. https://physionet.org/content/sampen/1.0.0/
   Reference: Richman & Moorman, Am. J. Physiol. Heart Circ. Physiol. 278, H2039 (2000).
   The original file header is kept in sampen.c; the core calculation is unchanged and a Python
   extension interface was added for pyhctsa.

2. mma.py -- Multiscale Multifractal Analysis (MMA.m), Copyright (C) 2014 Jan Gieraltowski.
   https://physionet.org/content/mma/1.0.0/
   Reference: Gieraltowski, Zebrowski & Baranowski, Phys. Rev. E 85, 021915 (2012).
   Python port of MMA.m as modified for hctsa (SC_MMA.m, B. D. Fulcher) and for pyhctsa.
